# МОДУЛЬ 3: МНОГОТЕТРАЭДРАЛЬНАЯ РЕШЕТКА И РЕКУРСИВНЫЕ КАПСУЛЫ ( () )
# ============================================================================
class RecursiveTetrahedralCapsule:
    """
    Капсула с поддержкой рекурсивной вложенности и многотетраэдральных связей.
    """
    def __init__(self, name: str, field_dims: Tuple[int, ...], vertices: tuple, depth: int = 1):
        self.name = name
        self.field_dims = field_dims
        self.coords_list = [list(v) for v in vertices]
        self.depth = depth
        self.sub_capsule: Optional['RecursiveTetrahedralCapsule'] = None

    def drift(self, tensor_field: np.ndarray, gradient_fields: List[np.ndarray]) -> None:
        dims = len(self.field_dims)
        for idx, vertex in enumerate(self.coords_list):
            best_coords = list(vertex)
            max_tension = -999.0
            for d in range(dims):
                for delta in [-1, 1]:
                    test_coords = list(vertex)
                    test_coords[d] += delta
                    if all(0 <= test_coords[i] < self.field_dims[i] for i in range(dims)):
                        local_val = abs(tensor_field[tuple(test_coords)])
                        grad_val = sum(abs(gradient_fields[i][tuple(test_coords)]) for i in range(dims))
                        tension = local_val + (grad_val * (2.0 * self.depth))
                        if tension > max_tension:
                            max_tension = tension
                            best_coords = test_coords
            self.coords_list[idx] = best_coords

        if self.sub_capsule:
            self.sub_capsule.drift(tensor_field, gradient_fields)

    def spawn_nested_capsule(self) -> None:
        if not self.sub_capsule and self.depth < 3:
            mid_v = [sum(x)//len(x) for x in zip(*self.coords_list)]
            offset_v = [max(0, c - 1) for c in mid_v]
            sub_verts = (
                tuple(mid_v),
                tuple(offset_v),
                tuple([min(self.field_dims[0]-1, c+1) for c in mid_v]),
                tuple([max(0, c-1) for c in offset_v])
            )
            self.sub_capsule = RecursiveTetrahedralCapsule(f"{self.name}-Sub", self.field_dims, sub_verts, self.depth + 1)

    def enforce_lattice_containment(self, tensor_field: PentarnyTensorField, evolution: PentarnyTensorEvolution, graph: PentarUniverseGraph, node_coords: Dict[str, Tuple[int, ...]]) -> None:
        all_coords = np.array(self.coords_list)
        min_b = np.min(all_coords, axis=0)
        max_b = np.max(all_coords, axis=0)

        for v in self.coords_list:
            tensor_field.inject_quantum_impulse(tuple(v), -2)
            evolution.propagate_wave(tuple(v), radius=1)

        for name, node in graph.nodes.items():
            if name in node_coords:
                n_coords = np.array(node_coords[name])
                if np.all(n_coords >= min_b) and np.all(n_coords <= max_b):
                    node.isolation_depth = self.depth
                else:
                    if node.isolation_depth == self.depth:
                        node.isolation_depth = 0

        if self.sub_capsule:
            self.sub_capsule.enforce_lattice_containment(tensor_field, evolution, graph, node_coords)


